// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`plain-text snapshots > deleted 1`] = `
"Subject: Your Stackcase account was deleted

Your account was deleted

Hi Ada,

As requested, your account has been deleted, together with your portfolio, projects, skills and sessions.

Portfolio

stackcase.test/ada

Deleted

28 Sep 2026, 07:15 UTC

Copies in backups expire on their normal schedule, as described in our Privacy Policy. Thanks for trying Stackcase. You're welcome back any time.

This is the last email you'll receive from Stackcase about this account.

stackcase.test https://stackcase.test/ · Privacy https://stackcase.test/privacy · Terms https://stackcase.test/terms

© 2026 Stackcase. All rights reserved."
`;

exports[`plain-text snapshots > password-changed 1`] = `
"Subject: Your Stackcase password was changed

Your password was changed

Hi Ada,

The password for your account was just changed. For your security, every other device was signed out.

What changed

Password

When

28 Sep 2026, 07:15 UTC

Wasn't you? Reset your password right away. The reset link goes only to this inbox.

Reset my password https://stackcase.test/forgot-password

You're receiving this security notice because it concerns your Stackcase account.

stackcase.test https://stackcase.test/ · Privacy https://stackcase.test/privacy · Terms https://stackcase.test/terms

© 2026 Stackcase. All rights reserved."
`;

exports[`plain-text snapshots > reset 1`] = `
"Subject: Reset your Stackcase password

Reset your password

Hi Ada,

We received a request to reset the password for your account. Choose a new one with the button below.

Choose a new password https://stackcase.test/reset-password?token=t

This link works for 60 minutes and can be used once. Didn't ask for this? You can safely ignore this email: your password stays the same, and nobody can change it without this link.

You're receiving this because a password reset was requested for your Stackcase account.

stackcase.test https://stackcase.test/ · Privacy https://stackcase.test/privacy · Terms https://stackcase.test/terms

© 2026 Stackcase. All rights reserved."
`;

exports[`plain-text snapshots > username-changed 1`] = `
"Subject: Your portfolio link is now stackcase.test/ada-dev

Your portfolio has a new link

Hi Ada,

Your username was changed. Here is what that means for your portfolio link:

Old address

stackcase.test/ada

New address

stackcase.test/ada-dev

Redirect

30 days from the old address

When

28 Sep 2026, 07:15 UTC

Update your CV, LinkedIn and GitHub profile with the new link. Nobody else can claim your old username while it redirects.

Open my portfolio https://stackcase.test/ada-dev

Wasn't you? Someone may have access to your account. Reset your password https://stackcase.test/forgot-password now.

