`;

exports[`plain-text snapshots > verify 1`] = `
"Subject: Confirm your email for Stackcase

Confirm your email

Hi Ada,

Welcome to Stackcase. Confirm this address so you can always get back into your account, for example to reset a forgotten password.

Confirm my email https://stackcase.test/verify-email?token=t

This link works for 24 hours and can be used once. If you didn't create an account, ignore this email and nothing will happen.

You're receiving this because this address was used to create a Stackcase account.

stackcase.test https://stackcase.test/ · Privacy https://stackcase.test/privacy · Terms https://stackcase.test/terms

© 2026 Stackcase. All rights reserved."
`;
